<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on Holderbank.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Holderbank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued five million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of Holderbank Financiere Glarus AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,150 CHF		 PREMIUM	9.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.45 CHF		  GEARING	12.7 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 24.APR.97-15.MAY.98   PAYDATE	24.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,128 CHF  NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  UIYY</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
